11	 * untouched (backward-compatible). When present it must be exactly 4 digits and,
12	 * for a city with a known region, fall within that region's range
13	 * (NSW 2000-2099, VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099). A city with no known region
14	 * accepts any 4-digit postcode. Rejects with {@link InvalidPostcodeException} (400).
15	 */
16	public class RequirePostcode {
